  "type": "ImplementationProfile",
  "prefLabel": "Buffer",
  "definition": "Implementation Profile of the operation Buffer, whose meaning is its activity type (activityType): the signature of the Generic Profile Geometry buffer, bound to data exchange formats.",
  "inScheme": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile",
